      "hash": "395210118b58bbf5",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "It seems Team Rocket is planning to make\\nSilph create a strong Pokémon.\\c\\nArghhh... But I don’t want them to take this\\nPorygon I created!\\c\\nI’ve got to get it out of here somehow..."
    },
